  m_text: Forty years on, the demonstration office is the Edison Electric Works on
    Pearl Street, and the whole town of Westgate wants lighting. Mr Edison swears
    by direct current. Mr Westinghouse says it will never reach past the next street.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
